{"nodes":[{"id":"adb1c1d1e1f10001","type":"text","text":"# Linux网络\n\n**模块说明**：OSI/TCP/IP + ip/ss/NM\n\n— 1 个笔记 —","x":-110,"y":-200,"width":260,"height":60,"color":"1"},{"id":"adb1c1d1e1f10002","type":"file","file":"Linux网络.md","x":-130,"y":-50,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"adb1c1d1e1f10003","type":"text","text":"Linux网络.md\n─────\n• §0 心智模型\n• §1 OSI 7 层\n• §2 TCP/IP 4 层\n• §3 网卡命名\n• §4 ip link\n• §5 ip addr\n• §6 ip route\n• §7 /etc/resolv.conf\n• §8 ping\n• §9 mtr\n• §10 /etc/services\n• §11 ss\n• §12 ss 实战\n• §13 端口占用\n• §14 NetworkManager\n• §15 nmtui\n• §16 nmcli\n• §17 静态 IP\n• §18 DHCP 改静态\n• §19 ifcfg\n• §20 速查表\n• §21 易错点\n• §22 面试追问\n• §23 链路","x":200,"y":-200,"width":380,"height":595}],"edges":[{"id":"edb1c1d1e1f10001","fromNode":"adb1c1d1e1f10001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"adb1c1d1e1f10002","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edb1c1d1e1f10002","fromNode":"adb1c1d1e1f10002","fromSide":"right","toNode":"adb1c1d1e1f10003","toSide":"left"}]}
